; +-----------------------------------------+
; EXPERIMENTAL / UNPROVEN - demo forward-test only, not for real money yet.
; The default profile (default.set) = this + a $20 trailing stop from +$10 + loss-streak pause 4.
; Same entries as experimental-d1-trend.set (score >= 6, D1 EMA50 trend direction,
;   M1, XAUUSDm, hedge OFF), but the $20 TP is a CHECKPOINT:
;   at +$20 the EA re-checks the signal score - still agrees -> keep the trade,
;   lock 50% of the move into the SL, next checkpoint $20 further; otherwise close.
;   SL stays a fixed $20 (CheckpointMaxSkips = 0: the stop is never pushed).
; Real-tick backtest, Jan-Jun 2026, $2,000 per month, 0.01 lot:
;   +67.7% over 6 months, but only 2/6 months profitable
;   (Jan +93.8, Feb -7.2, Mar -1.9, Apr -31.0, May -5.7, Jun +19.7 %),
;   intra-month drawdown up to 42%. Most of the profit came from 2 trend months.
; Requirements / warnings:
;   - Points assume a 3-digit gold quote (0.001): on a 2-digit symbol divide
;     SLValue/TPValue/ZonePoints/MaxSpreadPoints by 10.
;   - $20 stop at the 0.01 minimum lot: use ~$2,000+ for ~1% risk per trade.
;   - Needs a hedging account.
; 2025 check (generated ticks from real M1 bars - the broker has no real ticks before 2026):
;   +52.4% (8/12 months up, worst intra-month DD 22%). Fixed $20 bracket: +36.9%.
;   Note: the design was derived from data that included 2025 - not a blind test.
; +-----------------------------------------+
